| 1 | - | reruns | rerun: unit 3 takes `a`, which unit 4 took after it | `a` moved |
| 2 | reads `a` (1) | untouched | unit 1 provided the same `a` | `c` = 100 |
| 3 | takes `a` (1) | recompiles, runs | edited | `d` = 1000 |
| 4 | takes `a` (1) | recompile fails | `a` was given away by unit 3 | - |
